  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your mythic power fuels one of your most powerful spells.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Minor Spell Expertise<sup>APG</sup>, ability to cast 9th-level spells, mythic tier 10.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose one spell that you know of any level. You may cast that spell twice per day as a spell-like ability. The caster level for this spell-like ability is equal to your caster level in the class from whose spell list the spell is taken. The spell-like ability’s save DC is Charisma-based. If the spell has an expensive focus or material component, it may not be chosen for this feat. You cannot apply metamagic feats to this spell.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time you take the feat, it applies to a new spell.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc100\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
